 "meta": {
  "id": "2bc93155772f2204ecaf75b2f6ae7125",
  "name": {
   "zh": "精细抠像 · MatAnyone 2",
   "en": "Fine Matte · MatAnyone 2"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "MatAnyone 2 是面向人物视频抠像的框架，不走分割式的硬边，保住细节，在真实素材上更稳。这张卡的粗遮罩只算一帧（「粗遮罩取哪一帧」，留空 = 开始帧），默认由 BiRefNet 自动给出，也可以用 SAM 3 按提示词找再点选物体，或自己在视图里画；从这一帧抠出整段 alpha 后用「边缘解混合」去掉边缘的背景色，交付一套多层 EXR（rgba 修正后前景、foreground 未修正前景、alpha）。",
   "en": "MatAnyone 2 is a human video matting framework that avoids hard segmentation edges, keeps detail and is steadier on real footage. The rough mask is computed for one frame (Rough Mask Frame; empty = start frame): BiRefNet by default, SAM 3 from a prompt and picks, or drawn in the viewport. After matting the shot, edge unmixing removes background color from the edges; delivers an EXR (rgba, foreground, alpha)."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "matte_alpha",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
